{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":232,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1892389,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1428525092,"LastPoster":{"Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1892435,"PostDate":1428549400,"PostContent":"I agree with @RJE - it really depends on the where, when etc. 20-25 guests make it easier as a lo...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415547511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.94.109.103","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b95f73a0b4c49191f848a3f1e5bee206","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m trying to come up with some kind of savings plan and first things first...I need to set a budget!\n\n\nWe&#039;ve decided on Mexico and we are estimating 20-25 guests at the most. I definitely want the ceremony and reception on the beach, a cocktail hour, and a DJ.&amp;nbsp;\n\n\nIs $7,000 a realistic budget? (I&#039;m factoring in our flights and stay, wedding package, and about $500 for DIY decorations.)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892389,"PostDate":1428525092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm trying to come up with some kind of savings plan and first things first...I need to set a budget!<br><br>\nWe've decided on Mexico and we are estimating 20-25 guests at the most. I definitely want the ceremony and reception on the beach, a cocktail hour, and a DJ.\u00a0<br><br>\nIs $7,000 a realistic budget? (I'm factoring in our flights and stay, wedding package, and about $500 for DIY decorations.)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaspbri0317@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.58.144.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296688027,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaspbri0317","Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.184.35.89","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"38a2dfedcbf7f1dde46fc53ed2026773","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;It depends which resort you choose, time of the year, if you pick DJ from approved vendors etc&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Without all those details, $7000 seems doable!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892421,"PostDate":1428542306,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>It depends which resort you choose, time of the year, if you pick DJ from approved vendors etc<\/p>\n<p>Without all those details, $7000 seems doable!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ruth.craig.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.184.35.89","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425949901,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282373.jpg?_r=1425955850","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RJE","Id":282373,"Name":"RJE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.48.47.79","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d18bae92651d424ac8a9c1e2bf82617e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I agree with @[member=\"RJE\"] - it really depends on the where, when etc. 20-25 guests make it easier as a lot of wedding packages are based on that number. The approved vendors will be key as those fees can add up quickly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Our budget was $6000 without travel costs - just for the ceremony, reception, photography, and basic decor for 60 people. Groups larger than 25 we found hard to find an affordable package that suited our needs. Right now we&#039;re at 53 people and we&#039;re coming under budget. That of course doesn&#039;t include our travel costs, attire or gifts. Not sure if that helps but that&#039;s been our experience so far.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892435,"PostDate":1428549400,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I agree with @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282373\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282373-rje\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">RJE<\/span><\/a> - it really depends on the where, when etc. 20-25 guests make it easier as a lot of wedding packages are based on that number. The approved vendors will be key as those fees can add up quickly.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Our budget was $6000 without travel costs - just for the ceremony, reception, photography, and basic decor for 60 people. Groups larger than 25 we found hard to find an affordable package that suited our needs. Right now we're at 53 people and we're coming under budget. That of course doesn't include our travel costs, attire or gifts. Not sure if that helps but that's been our experience so far.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>My planning thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78916-snswedding2016-planning-thread-jan-9-2016-azul-fives\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"sean.n.steph2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.12.52.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415547511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281055.jpg?_r=1415590512","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"snswedding2016","Id":281055,"Name":"snswedding2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.137.211.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a651b5a307e35f1c15eded169b1ed2f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We have a similiar guest list and budget and we chose a resort in Riveria Maya in October which really helped drop the costs :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892441,"PostDate":1428550409,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We have a similiar guest list and budget and we chose a resort in Riveria Maya in October which really helped drop the costs <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"phimoez@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.137.211.49","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425876636,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MNsunseeker","Id":282367,"Name":"MNsunseeker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b2af6a805b77f8212309b3631000a5ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think that is totally doable! Our budget is less than that and we are really cutting corners in some areas. We scored on our photographer which saved us thousands! We are flying my friends room mate (photographer) down for a few days and she will shoot our wedding (8 hours of coverage)&amp;nbsp;in return! This is a great way to save money if you know a good photographer through the grapevine. We also picked a resort where the 11th person is free up to&amp;nbsp; a maximum of 4. We are expecting to get 3 free and are keeping the money to pay for wedding expenses. So in a nutshell, I think you can do a wedding for 7000$ no problem! Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892450,"PostDate":1428554401,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think that is totally doable! Our budget is less than that and we are really cutting corners in some areas. We scored on our photographer which saved us thousands! We are flying my friends room mate (photographer) down for a few days and she will shoot our wedding (8 hours of coverage)\u00a0in return! This is a great way to save money if you know a good photographer through the grapevine. We also picked a resort where the 11th person is free up to\u00a0 a maximum of 4. We are expecting to get 3 free and are keeping the money to pay for wedding expenses. So in a nutshell, I think you can do a wedding for 7000$ no problem! Good luck!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"millar_devon@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"154.20.36.21","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423329313,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"Victoriabride","Id":282027,"Name":"Victoriabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4636b839d5198541d4493eff1b21acd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;d say it&#039;s doable depending on your taste etc and the fees that your resort charges. I started out wanting to spend $6,000 for the wedding with 25-30 guests and i&#039;m spending over $8k now. When I first set a budget, my FI and I forgot about the fact that we had the USD exchange rate on our Canadian dollar.. that added %20-25 more to our budget.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There were also some additions along the way.. Ie. at the beginning we didn&#039;t consider a videographer, but then we decided later that we would really like a videographer. I&#039;d just say to prepare to spend a bit more than you were expecting.. If you do set a budget, just keep in mind that sometimes some parts don&#039;t always goto plan and there are some additional fees you may run into along the way.. another expense we didn&#039;t expect was the vendor fee that the resort charges. Not until we really got into planning our wedding did we realize that the resort charges fees to use any outside vendors.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892478,"PostDate":1428591494,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'd say it's doable depending on your taste etc and the fees that your resort charges. I started out wanting to spend $6,000 for the wedding with 25-30 guests and i'm spending over $8k now. When I first set a budget, my FI and I forgot about the fact that we had the USD exchange rate on our Canadian dollar.. that added %20-25 more to our budget.<\/p>\n<p>There were also some additions along the way.. Ie. at the beginning we didn't consider a videographer, but then we decided later that we would really like a videographer. I'd just say to prepare to spend a bit more than you were expecting.. If you do set a budget, just keep in mind that sometimes some parts don't always goto plan and there are some additional fees you may run into along the way.. another expense we didn't expect was the vendor fee that the resort charges. Not until we really got into planning our wedding did we realize that the resort charges fees to use any outside vendors.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"143.58.161.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ebc8c1d737a806b67a943168aef4bbe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/236302-jaspbri0317\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;jaspbri0317&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- There are so many factors that go into the price of a destination wedding, so it&#039;s really hard to say. Our ten day trip alone is $5800. The DJ is $1300. We hired an outside photographer, which is over $2k (and that&#039;s on the lower end of photog prices). We have 28 guests + us. We added some extras, but our wedding package is actually very inclusive.&amp;nbsp;Just be very careful when it comes to pricing for the wedding with the resort you choose. Some include nearly everything in the package and others will literally charge you for chairs, napkins, per hour of the reception, etc.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m not saying that $7k isn&#039;t doable, it just depends on which resort you end up choosing and what they include vs. what you end up wanting.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892481,"PostDate":1428591953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/236302-jaspbri0317\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>jaspbri0317<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0- There are so many factors that go into the price of a destination wedding, so it's really hard to say. Our ten day trip alone is $5800. The DJ is $1300. We hired an outside photographer, which is over $2k (and that's on the lower end of photog prices). We have 28 guests + us. We added some extras, but our wedding package is actually very inclusive.\u00a0Just be very careful when it comes to pricing for the wedding with the resort you choose. Some include nearly everything in the package and others will literally charge you for chairs, napkins, per hour of the reception, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm not saying that $7k isn't doable, it just depends on which resort you end up choosing and what they include vs. what you end up wanting.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jhowe114@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.98.131.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1402426389,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278395.jpg?_r=1421871115","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":285,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferH114","Id":278395,"Name":"JenniferH114","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.51.43.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79038,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01804bbc79c0c56661c7ff553499c59d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Your main costs that will not give you much wiggle room are resort\/airfare -- definitely compare your options and also consider time of year. Look into smaller resorts, resort specials (I know the BDW travel agents Wright Travel are currently offering a lot of special, including bride\/groom fly free!!) Here&#039;s a link to the travel deals page on the forum:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/124-travel-deals\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/124-travel-deals\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also depending on where you&#039;re staying, look into staying in a beach villa or condos -- we along with most of our guests did this when we got married in Mexico and it worked out perfectly! We actually rented a villa and had our welcome dinner on the property and through it was just our welcome dinner, it was wedding quality!! (Wedding\/reception was elsewhere). If you go this route, you may also want to consider reaching out to a wedding planner and ask if your budget is feasible.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cut back on decor costs -- I promise you, when you get married at a destination location, your scenery is really all the decor you need! Keep florals and decor simple and you can save tons!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892527,"PostDate":1428614453,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Your main costs that will not give you much wiggle room are resort\/airfare -- definitely compare your options and also consider time of year. Look into smaller resorts, resort specials (I know the BDW travel agents Wright Travel are currently offering a lot of special, including bride\/groom fly free!!) Here's a link to the travel deals page on the forum:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/124-travel-deals\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...4-travel-deals\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also depending on where you're staying, look into staying in a beach villa or condos -- we along with most of our guests did this when we got married in Mexico and it worked out perfectly! We actually rented a villa and had our welcome dinner on the property and through it was just our welcome dinner, it was wedding quality!! (Wedding\/reception was elsewhere). If you go this route, you may also want to consider reaching out to a wedding planner and ask if your budget is feasible.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cut back on decor costs -- I promise you, when you get married at a destination location, your scenery is really all the decor you need! Keep florals and decor simple and you can save tons!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 18px;'><span style='font-family: georgia'><strong class='bbc'>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br \/>\nWEBSITE: <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com'>www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br \/>\nBLOG: <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com'>www.mariesamsanchezblog.com<\/a><br \/>\nCONTACT: <a href='mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry' title='E-mail Link' class='bbc_email'>mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<img src='http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg' alt='Posted Image' class='bbc_img' \/>","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285954345,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79038","Title":"Realistic Budget?","LastPostDate":1428614453},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
