doesn&#039;t open until valentines day! Please let me know your experiences","Attachments":[],"Id":1884260,"PostDate":1422330524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married in May 2015 and very nervous since this resort doesn't open until valentines day! Please let me know your experiences\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandaipelletier@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.163.113.199","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422330113,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"amandapanda","Id":281888,"Name":"amandapanda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.166.154.81","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aaacd41effbabef3c31917fbab1084de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"amandapanda\"] - there are a couple of us posting on another board. &amp;nbsp;i&#039;m also getting married in may there! &amp;nbsp;may 30, 2015. &amp;nbsp;when is your wedding date? &amp;nbsp;i will be going to visit in march, so will let you know my impressions&lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78597-finest-20152016-brides\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78597-finest-20152016-brides\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886800,"PostDate":1424356434,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281888\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281888-amandapanda\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">amandapanda<\/span><\/a> - there are a couple of us posting on another board. \u00a0i'm also getting married in may there! \u00a0may 30, 2015. \u00a0when is your wedding date? \u00a0i will be going to visit in march, so will let you know my impressions<\/p>\n<br \/><p><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78597-finest-20152016-brides\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...0152016-brides\/<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"susieylee@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"173.166.154.81","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1415028059,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280976.jpg?_r=1424642440","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":230,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"airsusie","Id":280976,"Name":"airsusie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.72.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02804c86a9117908037555b9e5398027","RawContent":"Hi everyone. My fianc\u00e9 and I have decided to get married at the finest resort in November 2015. I contacted the resort and they gave me their availability and the cost details. I now at the point that I need to confirm the date with the resort so I can start sending out save the dates and details to my guests. How did you guys get your confirmation? Did you have to put down a deposit? \n\nI&#039;m a little nervous about how the wedding planning is going to work out...","Attachments":[],"Id":1886804,"PostDate":1424359121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi everyone. My fianc\u00e9 and I have decided to get married at the finest resort in November 2015. I contacted the resort and they gave me their availability and the cost details. I now at the point that I need to confirm the date with the resort so I can start sending out save the dates and details to my guests. How did you guys get your confirmation? Did you have to put down a deposit? <br>\nI'm a little nervous about how the wedding planning is going to work out... \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nilou.ebrahimi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.183.176.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424015726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NE112015","Id":282124,"Name":"NE112015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.42.29.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb8864c2ca2b7c9974ec5e3970a1deb5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just booked my wedding at Finest as well.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In order to confirm your wedding date you do not need to put down a deposit, they want you to book your stay at the resort.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I had been contacting Laura Jimenez and she sent me a form to fill out and you need to provide them with your resort booking confirmation number, expected number of guests, wedding package you want etc...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886875,"PostDate":1424387880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just booked my wedding at Finest as well.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In order to confirm your wedding date you do not need to put down a deposit, they want you to book your stay at the resort.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I had been contacting Laura Jimenez and she sent me a form to fill out and you need to provide them with your resort booking confirmation number, expected number of guests, wedding package you want etc...\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"p1x1st1ck@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.42.29.14","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422396844,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Pixistick","Id":281906,"Name":"Pixistick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.102.249.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79b87259a1c7c3941475da30d991d9ed","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks @[member=\"airsusie\"]!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886900,"PostDate":1424397765,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280976\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280976-airsusie\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">airsusie<\/span><\/a>!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandaipelletier@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.163.113.199","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1422330113,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"amandapanda","Id":281888,"Name":"amandapanda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.72.49","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce8d2216d5ccf31b602b98a248c370b6","RawContent":"Thank you! I&#039;ve been in contact with Laura too and she just send me the booking information. Have you been able to reserve a block of rooms for your guests?","Attachments":[],"Id":1886970,"PostDate":1424455028,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you! I've been in contact with Laura too and she just send me the booking information. Have you been able to reserve a block of rooms for your guests?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nilou.ebrahimi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.183.176.208","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424015726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"NE112015","Id":282124,"Name":"NE112015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"156.33.241.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78686,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a5672636d4fc4c68203225aed0264c86","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello ladies and congrats!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281906-pixistick\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Pixistick&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;What are the venue options at this resort? Is it beach only?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891413,"PostDate":1427815398,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello ladies and congrats!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281906-pixistick\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>Pixistick<\/span><\/a><\/span>\u00a0What are the venue options at this resort? Is it beach only?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Amaqt03@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"98.169.122.6","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1352510505,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-262240.jpg?_r=1421980656","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissAmber26","Id":262240,"Name":"MissAmber26","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78686","Title":"The Finest Resort In Playa Mujeres Brides Post Here!","LastPostDate":1427815398},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
