lse,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3feb736c37d0197ba4c6ee8e919c0a9a","RawContent":"I&#039;m also considering that venue\n\n\nSent from my SPH-L720 using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1841766,"PostDate":1396324339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm also considering that venue<br><br>\nSent from my SPH-L720 using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396280519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.219.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"03b50c13d5838fcef2a614f8d3a42e5b","RawContent":"We&#039;re booking our wedding at the Riu Peninsula for May 2015. @[member=\"Pablou\"] I&#039;d love to hear how you planning goes","Attachments":[],"Id":1841777,"PostDate":1396335161,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're booking our wedding at the Riu Peninsula for May 2015. @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> I'd love to hear how you planning goes \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"campbell22k@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"149.254.219.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396334311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jaycee272","Id":277434,"Name":"Jaycee272","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.205.169.245","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b0a2c69291c670ba51f93810d6d3a29","RawContent":"@[member=\"Jaycee272\"]  have you booked it yet? We have booked ours. Still waiting to here from the wc tho so we can start organising. I&#039;m so excited do u have ideas yet? X","Attachments":[],"Id":1841780,"PostDate":1396339926,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277434\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277434-jaycee272\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jaycee272<\/span><\/a>  have you booked it yet? We have booked ours. Still waiting to here from the wc tho so we can start organising. I'm so excited do u have ideas yet? X\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390397854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.219.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3a30b0ddf547053837b9606b3fa4f55","RawContent":"@[member=\"Pablou\"] we haven&#039;t booked yet as we are waiting for the May dates to be released. We have an appointment with our travel agent in a few weeks to book though so i&#039;m excited about that :) \n\n\nNot many ideas yet, waiting until we have RSVP&#039;s from guests to get an idea of numbers attending and then we cant start planning our evening reception. How about you? \n\n\nHave you visited the Riu Peninsula before? x","Attachments":[],"Id":1841782,"PostDate":1396341267,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> we haven't booked yet as we are waiting for the May dates to be released. We have an appointment with our travel agent in a few weeks to book though so i'm excited about that <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br>\nNot many ideas yet, waiting until we have RSVP's from guests to get an idea of numbers attending and then we cant start planning our evening reception. How about you? <br><br>\nHave you visited the Riu Peninsula before? x\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"campbell22k@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"149.254.219.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396334311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jaycee272","Id":277434,"Name":"Jaycee272","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"176.250.0.177","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee651870805b32891f59a2091a48f240","RawContent":"@[member=\"Jaycee272\"]. You&#039;ll b mega excited then eh? Ours is all booked. Can&#039;t wait. Not any further forward with reception etc as not heard from wc to organise just yet. Tbh I think we have only bout 15 others going so probs just be dinner n something small. I couldn&#039;t wait for every one to get back to is before we booked as people kept changing there minds so if they r coming they can just book on to our booking. I haven&#039;t visited here before no. Have u? Last time we were in mexico we stayed at moon palace. Loved it and would go there in a sec but it was the prices for other guests we had to think about. Xx","Attachments":[],"Id":1841790,"PostDate":1396347864,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277434\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277434-jaycee272\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jaycee272<\/span><\/a>. You'll b mega excited then eh? Ours is all booked. Can't wait. Not any further forward with reception etc as not heard from wc to organise just yet. Tbh I think we have only bout 15 others going so probs just be dinner n something small. I couldn't wait for every one to get back to is before we booked as people kept changing there minds so if they r coming they can just book on to our booking. I haven't visited here before no. Have u? Last time we were in mexico we stayed at moon palace. Loved it and would go there in a sec but it was the prices for other guests we had to think about. Xx\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390397854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"149.254.219.80","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"728bbbe109e0a00e6d9cdac3cc264dfe","RawContent":"@[member=\"Pablou\"] yes, can&#039;t wait to get it booked now! I haven&#039;t actually sent out any invites yet as i&#039;m told it can take up up to 8 weeks to get our wedding date confirmed though. i&#039;m under the impression that most elements of the wedding plans get sorted when you arrive at the hotel - not sure how I feel about that!!  I&#039;ve found some useful info and pics from old posts on this site showing what the hotel can offer though.\n\n\nI&#039;ve never been to Mexico, we chose it simply because the hotel looked amazing and there is enough around locally for people to leave the hotel a go out if they want to. X","Attachments":[],"Id":1841796,"PostDate":1396355315,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> yes, can't wait to get it booked now! I haven't actually sent out any invites yet as i'm told it can take up up to 8 weeks to get our wedding date confirmed though. i'm under the impression that most elements of the wedding plans get sorted when you arrive at the hotel - not sure how I feel about that!!  I've found some useful info and pics from old posts on this site showing what the hotel can offer though.<br><br>\nI've never been to Mexico, we chose it simply because the hotel looked amazing and there is enough around locally for people to leave the hotel a go out if they want to. X\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"campbell22k@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"149.254.219.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396334311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jaycee272","Id":277434,"Name":"Jaycee272","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.87.149.2","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"db165fceada3abcf9b4f23523d153dc1","RawContent":"Now Jade May 30, 2015!","Attachments":[],"Id":1841800,"PostDate":1396356198,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Now Jade May 30, 2015!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.2.3.193","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"57dbe2a3f396d58d9d2c3a21b74d1ce1","RawContent":"@[member=\"Jaycee272\"]. We got our wedding date through two weeks ago so yeah it was about 8 weeks since when we booked. I have an idea of everything I like and would like so it&#039;s just matter of getting it all organised. The only thing I&#039;m not too sure about is the fact u can&#039;t get married on the beach now. I&#039;m not too happy bout that as that&#039;s what I wanted. So I&#039;ll Nd to saying to the wc about it. What pictures do u have ? I have seen a few videos of pictures and weddings but not very many on the Internet. Could u share some? X","Attachments":[],"Id":1841851,"PostDate":1396370543,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277434\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277434-jaycee272\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Jaycee272<\/span><\/a>. We got our wedding date through two weeks ago so yeah it was about 8 weeks since when we booked. I have an idea of everything I like and would like so it's just matter of getting it all organised. The only thing I'm not too sure about is the fact u can't get married on the beach now. I'm not too happy bout that as that's what I wanted. So I'll Nd to saying to the wc about it. What pictures do u have ? I have seen a few videos of pictures and weddings but not very many on the Internet. Could u share some? X\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390397854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":63,