{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1396370820,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8457d9237aaade0ea3013dc6b7551e5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;@[member=\"Pablou\"] What do you mean you can&#039;t get married on the beach? I recently booked my wedding for the beach and they said nothing about that!!!!&amp;nbsp; :o&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;font-size:14px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;font-size:14px;\"&gt;EDIT: .. oh nevermind, for some reason I thought we had booked the same resort... my mistake. That&#039;s terrible that you can&#039;t get married on the beach though! What is the resort&#039;s reasoning for that??&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841855,"PostDate":1396370705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\">@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> What do you mean you can't get married on the beach? I recently booked my wedding for the beach and they said nothing about that!!!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/><\/span><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;font-size:14px\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;font-size:14px\">EDIT: .. oh nevermind, for some reason I thought we had booked the same resort... my mistake. That's terrible that you can't get married on the beach though! What is the resort's reasoning for that??<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391620956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6da585197a0f8827160c3e730d5ac5a6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congratulations brides!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Every time is closer to your wedding day,&amp;nbsp;is exciting to hear all that and plan what they will do!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=core:attachments:27149]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=core:attachments:27139]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We wish the best for all of you,&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;We are photographers and we also do videography,&amp;nbsp;capturing those moments that will not return ever on that special day!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Please take a look at our photography work:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;if you have doubts or questions gladly attend you your doubts.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Have a nice day, Greetings!&amp;nbsp; :)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Hello future brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Our job is to give them the best service at the best price, We work in Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, Cozumel, etc; we have different packages to suit your budget!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;A photographer for a wedding is important because we will capture those unforgettable moments on that special day!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;Please take a look at the wedding of Nathalie and Richard that took place at Dreams Tulum,&amp;nbsp;this wedding was so tender and beautiful.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40);\"&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74483]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=core:attachments:27140]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;\"&gt;if you have doubts or questions gladly attend you your doubts.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div style=\"margin:0px;\"&gt;Have a nice day, Greetings!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841868,"PostDate":1396374116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congratulations brides!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Every time is closer to your wedding day,\u00a0is exciting to hear all that and plan what they will do!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1839713]' id='ipb-attach-url-27149-0-34671700-1428635310' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-70575700-1395427719.jpg\" title=\"_A5A8114.JPG -  478.67KB\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-70575700-1395427719_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27149-0-34671700-1428635310' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"_A5A8114.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1839676]' id='ipb-attach-url-27139-0-35353800-1428635310' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-26058100-1395419692.jpg\" title=\"_A5A9480.JPG -  371.37KB\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-26058100-1395419692_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27139-0-35353800-1428635310' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"_A5A9480.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We wish the best for all of you,\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">We are photographers and we also do videography,\u00a0capturing those moments that will not return ever on that special day!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Please take a look at our photography work:\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">if you have doubts or questions gladly attend you your doubts.<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Have a nice day, Greetings!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div><br \/><p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Hello future brides!<\/p>\n<p  style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Our job is to give them the best service at the best price, We work in Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, Cozumel, etc; we have different packages to suit your budget!<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">A photographer for a wedding is important because we will capture those unforgettable moments on that special day!<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">Please take a look at the wedding of Nathalie and Richard that took place at Dreams Tulum,\u00a0this wedding was so tender and beautiful.<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.octaviomontes.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com<\/a><\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(40,40,40)\">\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/74483-dreams-tulum-chappel\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17608\/sml_gallery_238129_17608_155241.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Dreams Tulum Chappel'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Dreams Tulum Chappel' id='sml_image_view_74483' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1839677]' id='ipb-attach-url-27140-0-38731600-1428635310' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-26747600-1395420251.jpg\" title=\"_A5A8799.JPG -  330.77KB\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-26747600-1395420251_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27140-0-38731600-1428635310' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"_A5A8799.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">if you have doubts or questions gladly attend you your doubts.<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div  style=\"margin:0px\">Have a nice day, Greetings!<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"octavio@momocode.com","IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1300997247,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238129.png?_r=1394907225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"omontes","Id":238129,"Name":"omontes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.210.196.230","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c213ab26e07bc9eb92c394e2ba6b275","RawContent":"@[member=\"LauraM\"]  I&#039;m not sure to be honest. It was just when I was in travel agent the man in there phoned riu regarding another matter and they said they no longer do weddings on the sand now. It&#039;s got to b in the garden area next to the beach.","Attachments":[],"Id":1841901,"PostDate":1396382472,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276518\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276518-lauram\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LauraM<\/span><\/a>  I'm not sure to be honest. It was just when I was in travel agent the man in there phoned riu regarding another matter and they said they no longer do weddings on the sand now. It's got to b in the garden area next to the beach. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390397854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"92.232.60.121","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98ac02c31261013fd62836237f08b990","RawContent":"@[member=\"Pablou\"] I found some pics of different wedding options on this feed here &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71717-riu-palace-peninsula-2013-brides\/page-2&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71717-riu-palace-peninsula-2013-brides\/page-2&lt;\/a&gt; i found it useful to give me an idea of the kind of decorations\/options to expect. Hope you find this useful if you haven&#039;t seen it already :) X","Attachments":[],"Id":1841913,"PostDate":1396388195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276261\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276261-pablou\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Pablou<\/span><\/a> I found some pics of different wedding options on this feed here <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/71717-riu-palace-peninsula-2013-brides\/page-2' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...3-brides\/page-2<\/a> i found it useful to give me an idea of the kind of decorations\/options to expect. Hope you find this useful if you haven't seen it already <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> X  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"campbell22k@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"149.254.219.80","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396334311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Jaycee272","Id":277434,"Name":"Jaycee272","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5727977eb1da9ac982315061f0d2ba28","RawContent":"June 23, 2015 at Moon Palace Resort","Attachments":[],"Id":1841983,"PostDate":1396410839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                June 23, 2015 at Moon Palace Resort\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383053267,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.126.108.7","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2a8d5369245ca537a7ae9bf030df6d2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Good afternoon ladies,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have been reading comments but, haven&#039;t had a minute to write myself. Our wedding is set for July 18,2015 at the Gran Caribe in Cancun. We have confirmed DJ Doremixx and I am currently getting rates from photographers and videographers. I think once&amp;nbsp;those two are decided everything else will be downhill.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The only hard part is that I am ready to start buying stuff but, can&#039;t do too much until&amp;nbsp;we have&amp;nbsp;more of a headcount.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I are going on a site visit May 16-19 and also doing a food tasting. I&#039;m thinking once I can see everything it will be easier for me to finish planning as far as the flowers, centerpieces, etc. I will take lots of pictures and share once I return.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning and good luck to all the upcoming brides. I hope everything go smoothly and you enjoy your day. :-)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Chalonda&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842651,"PostDate":1396644350,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Good afternoon ladies,<\/p>\n<p>I have been reading comments but, haven't had a minute to write myself. Our wedding is set for July 18,2015 at the Gran Caribe in Cancun. We have confirmed DJ Doremixx and I am currently getting rates from photographers and videographers. I think once\u00a0those two are decided everything else will be downhill.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The only hard part is that I am ready to start buying stuff but, can't do too much until\u00a0we have\u00a0more of a headcount.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I are going on a site visit May 16-19 and also doing a food tasting. I'm thinking once I can see everything it will be easier for me to finish planning as far as the flowers, centerpieces, etc. I will take lots of pictures and share once I return.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning and good luck to all the upcoming brides. I hope everything go smoothly and you enjoy your day. :-)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Chalonda<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chalonda26@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"38.126.108.7","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1359493490,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265340.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":157,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"crcombs","Id":265340,"Name":"crcombs","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"90.203.151.19","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1fc7573a325ef08482e74c4143234a5","RawContent":"Congratulations. I&#039;m getting married to the hotel right next door to you. The palace peninsula April 2015. Haven&#039;t really organised anything as of yet as just got our wedding date through.","Attachments":[],"Id":1842654,"PostDate":1396646522,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations. I'm getting married to the hotel right next door to you. The palace peninsula April 2015. Haven't really organised anything as of yet as just got our wedding date through. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390397854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.126.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"addd97547082f30d588720ff67616a1f","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hi Ladies.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;having all of you, happy plannings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;2015 will be wonderful.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;https:\/\/vimeo.com\/64128045&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843583,"PostDate":1397110875,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hi Ladies.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>having all of you, happy plannings.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>2015 will be wonderful.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/64128045\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@gallardofilms.com","IpAddress":"200.79.246.186","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1329332690,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251447.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gallardo films","Id":251447,"Name":"gallardo films","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.120.68.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"015895ca71970fc7ab867d94a9db7c6d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married May 16th 2015 at Hard Rock Cancun! I&#039;m in the process of finalizing my date now!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843953,"PostDate":1397248939,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married May 16th 2015 at Hard Rock Cancun! I'm in the process of finalizing my date now!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aylanickens@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.120.68.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1383599312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274820.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ASAtobe","Id":274820,"Name":"ASAtobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"51a2e788b096f65feac55a197f2b2a37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats to everyone planning in Cancun!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m looking at our vow renewal in Playa del Carmen October 20, 2015 so a long way to go yet, but I did look at Cancun too. Just decided Playa was smaller and easier to get around.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843954,"PostDate":1397249612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats to everyone planning in Cancun!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm looking at our vow renewal in Playa del Carmen October 20, 2015 so a long way to go yet, but I did look at Cancun too. Just decided Playa was smaller and easier to get around.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedN