{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"177.237.126.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbcc6db79b52e5fff9af5f95ce60deed","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hi brides!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Cancun is one of the best places to celebrate your wedding!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;A few months ago we shared a Same Day Edit production of a hindu wedding,&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;now we want you to watch the Highlight of that hindu wedding,&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;It is very interesting to know more about this culture trough the traditions of the brides and grooms.&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Hope you like it,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[media]https&#58;\/\/vimeo.com\/91132306[\/media]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844384,"PostDate":1397524884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hi brides!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Cancun is one of the best places to celebrate your wedding!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>A few months ago we shared a Same Day Edit production of a hindu wedding,<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>now we want you to watch the Highlight of that hindu wedding,<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>It is very interesting to know more about this culture trough the traditions of the brides and grooms.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Hope you like it,\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Happy planning!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><iframe src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/91132306\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" frameborder=\"0\"><\/iframe><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@gallardofilms.com","IpAddress":"200.79.246.186","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1329332690,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251447.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gallardo films","Id":251447,"Name":"gallardo films","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.251.7.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c775d29b6d976ab1a64f10983da27409","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just waiting for the confirmation letter! We booked Dreams Riviera Cancun for April 17th, 2015!!! :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844494,"PostDate":1397589619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just waiting for the confirmation letter! We booked Dreams Riviera Cancun for April 17th, 2015!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396280519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1418322086","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":179,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"176.250.30.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6855a26775193c5b90936e71a3d62f4","RawContent":"Aw that&#039;s fantastic. Were just waiting to hear from wc. Exciting eh?","Attachments":[],"Id":1844510,"PostDate":1397591609,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Aw that's fantastic. Were just waiting to hear from wc. Exciting eh? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"louisepinkjay@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"85.255.232.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1390397854,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276261.png?_r=1397631220","PhotoWidth":60,"PhotoHeight":80,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pablou","Id":276261,"Name":"Pablou","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.68.64","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c1b15f1e680e6987c7ecdcc0d9459f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"crcombs\"] Let us know if you&#039;re interested in doing an Engagement\/Save the Date session while you&#039;re here in May. It&#039;s a nice way to meet face to face to talk more about your wedding and really go over the look and feel you&#039;re after ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We have a special promotion for couples who would like a pre-session and also book us for their wedding day!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0510-113copy.jpg.html\"]&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0510-113copy.jpg\"]http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0510-113copy.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"DSC_0510-113copy.jpg\"&gt;[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0309-32copy.jpg.html\"]&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0309-32copy.jpg\"]http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0309-32copy.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"DSC_0309-32copy.jpg\"&gt;[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0544-120copy.jpg.html\"]&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0544-120copy.jpg\"]http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0544-120copy.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"DSC_0544-120copy.jpg\"&gt;[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[url=\"http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0612-149copy.jpg.html\"]&lt;img src=\"[url=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0612-149copy.jpg\"]http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0612-149copy.jpg\"[\/url] alt=\"DSC_0612-149copy.jpg\"&gt;[\/url]&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1844530,"PostDate":1397598255,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"265340\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/265340-crcombs\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">crcombs<\/span><\/a> Let us know if you're interested in doing an Engagement\/Save the Date session while you're here in May. It's a nice way to meet face to face to talk more about your wedding and really go over the look and feel you're after <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We have a special promotion for couples who would like a pre-session and also book us for their wedding day!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0510-113copy.jpg.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0510-113copy.jpg\" alt=\"DSC_0510-113copy.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0309-32copy.jpg.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0309-32copy.jpg\" alt=\"DSC_0309-32copy.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0544-120copy.jpg.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0544-120copy.jpg\" alt=\"DSC_0544-120copy.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/s598.photobucket.com\/user\/bicoastalimages\/media\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0612-149copy.jpg.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i598.photobucket.com\/albums\/tt68\/bicoastalimages\/Destination%20Weddings\/DSC_0612-149copy.jpg\" alt=\"DSC_0612-149copy.jpg\"><\/span><\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bicoastalimages@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.153.57.154","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1328007668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250764.jpg?_r=1392999583","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bicoastalimages","Id":250764,"Name":"bicoastalimages","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d976c8c59068f0c861ad85eea997e2f9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ASAtobe\" post=\"1843953\" timestamp=\"1397248939\"]\nI&#039;m getting married May 16th 2015 at Hard Rock Cancun! I&#039;m in the process of finalizing my date now![\/quote]\n\nCongratulations ASAtobe!\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]Every time is closer to your wedding day, is exciting to hear all that and plan what they will do![\/font][\/color]\n\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com\"]http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com[\/url]\n\n[sharedmedia=gallery:images:74782]\n\n[sharedmedia=core:attachments:27157]\n\n[sharedmedia=core:attachments:27120]\n\n[color=rgb(40,40,40)][font=arial]We wish the best for all of you!![\/font][\/color]\n\nHappy planing girls, Greetings!!  :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1844690,"PostDate":1397668295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>ASAtobe, on 11 April 2014 - 12:42 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I'm getting married May 16th 2015 at Hard Rock Cancun! I'm in the process of finalizing my date now!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congratulations ASAtobe!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Every time is closer to your wedding day,\u00a0is exciting to hear all that and plan what they will do!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.OctavioMontes.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/image\/74782-a5a9435\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17628\/sml_gallery_238129_17628_74543.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='A5A9435'  width='200' height='134'  alt='A5A9435' id='sml_image_view_74782' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1839734]' id='ipb-attach-url-27157-0-91326700-1428635385' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-32130500-1395431269.jpg\" title=\"_A5A4467.JPG -  346.09KB\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-32130500-1395431269_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27157-0-91326700-1428635385' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"_A5A4467.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1839278]' id='ipb-attach-url-27120-0-92002900-1428635385' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-67755200-1395251071.jpg\" title=\"_A5A1603.JPG -  269.55KB\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_03_2014\/post-238129-0-67755200-1395251071_thumb.jpg\" id='ipb-attach-img-27120-0-92002900-1428635385' style='width:300;height:200' class='attach' width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"_A5A1603.JPG\" \/><\/span><\/a>\n<\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">We wish the best for all of you!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planing girls, Greetings!!\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"octavio@momocode.com","IpAddress":"189.221.96.179","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1300997247,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238129.png?_r=1394907225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"omontes","Id":238129,"Name":"omontes","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16b994fd94fa8b6731d8b301f6b3fdd4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi all,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re planning to have a wedding in Cancun in April 2015. We&#039;d like to keep the price of hotel+airfare from Toronto at $1500, however whatever quote we get from TA&#039;s is way higher than that. i.e. Beach Palace $2400 and Riu Palace Mexico $1900 for one week all-inclusive. These rates seem too high to be true. Can some of you share the deals you&#039;ve got. Do you know when&#039;s the best time to book? and also is Jan-Mar cheaper than this? I originally thought prices in late April are lower but it really doesn&#039;t look like it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845021,"PostDate":1397784489,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi all,<\/p>\n<p>We're planning to have a wedding in Cancun in April 2015. We'd like to keep the price of hotel+airfare from Toronto at $1500, however whatever quote we get from TA's is way higher than that. i.e. Beach Palace $2400 and Riu Palace Mexico $1900 for one week all-inclusive. These rates seem too high to be true. Can some of you share the deals you've got. Do you know when's the best time to book? and also is Jan-Mar cheaper than this? I originally thought prices in late April are lower but it really doesn't look like it.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mona1362@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.232.115.176","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397781966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277636.jpg?_r=1403744745","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mazarin","Id":277636,"Name":"mazarin","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d328fd74bdfcbba71f9f78166300906","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"mazarin\"] - If you&#039;re flexible with your dates, I&#039;d probably try to do it after this because Jan - March is generally high season because of Spring break\/March break. I am looking at December 2014 from Toronto and it is considerably cheaper than Feb (like 500 less for the same resort!)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845040,"PostDate":1397794008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277636\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277636-mazarin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mazarin<\/span><\/a> - If you're flexible with your dates, I'd probably try to do it after this because Jan - March is generally high season because of Spring break\/March break. I am looking at December 2014 from Toronto and it is considerably cheaper than Feb (like 500 less for the same resort!)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395609348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ed8b90f1e77bec3e97e106e6721fe221","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mazarin\" post=\"1845021\" timestamp=\"1397784489\"]\nHi all,\nWe&#039;re planning to have a wedding in Cancun in April 2015. We&#039;d like to keep the price of hotel+airfare from Toronto at $1500, however whatever quote we get from TA&#039;s is way higher than that. i.e. Beach Palace $2400 and Riu Palace Mexico $1900 for one week all-inclusive. These rates seem too high to be true. Can some of you share the deals you&#039;ve got. Do you know when&#039;s the best time to book? and also is Jan-Mar cheaper than this? I originally thought prices in late April are lower but it really doesn&#039;t look like it.[\/quote]We considered March and April as well. As previously mentioned,  that&#039;s considered high season for Cancun. We went with May and saved a couple hundred bucks. \n\nI would ask for quotes for May and June or November and December.  I suppose hurricane season months would be cheaper as well.","Attachments":[],"Id":1845044,"PostDate":1397813921,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>mazarin, on 17 April 2014 - 05:28 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>\nHi all,<br>\nWe're planning to have a wedding in Cancun in April 2015. We'd like to keep the price of hotel+airfare from Toronto at $1500, however whatever quote we get from TA's is way higher than that. i.e. Beach Palace $2400 and Riu Palace Mexico $1900 for one week all-inclusive. These rates seem too high to be true. Can some of you share the deals you've got. Do you know when's the best time to book? and also is Jan-Mar cheaper than this? I originally thought prices in late April are lower but it really doesn't look like it.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWe considered March and April as well. As previously mentioned,  that's considered high season for Cancun. We went with May and saved a couple hundred bucks. <br><br>\nI would ask for quotes for May and June or November and December.  I suppose hurricane season months would be cheaper as well. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carter.watson2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.47.13.201","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1393538930,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276925.jpg?_r=1393540000","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AyeWatSoon","Id":276925,"Name":"AyeWatSoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.153.68.64","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4c6798e8ddcefcb03e287c021af69a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey @[member=\"mazarin\"],&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"tygrrlily\"] &amp;amp; @[member=\"AyeWatSoon\"] are right. Anytime between January-April is still considered high season here in Cancun and especially when you&#039;re looking at booking a year in advance the rates are going to be a bit higher (or a LOT higher) depending on the week and resort. Often our couples are still able to find some great deals during the \"shoulder\" months (like May-June or Nov-Dec) or of course during September-November.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you&#039;re flexible with the month and resort...since you&#039;re from Toronto (my hometown...yay!) you&#039;re really lucky because there are so many awesome charter options leaving from YYZ to CUN all year long!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy searching!!! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845081,"PostDate":1397838008,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277636\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277636-mazarin\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">mazarin<\/span><\/a>,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277296\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277296-tygrrlily\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">tygrrlily<\/span><\/a> & @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276925\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276925-ayewatsoon\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AyeWatSoon<\/span><\/a> are right. Anytime between January-April is still considered high season here in Cancun and especially when you're looking at booking a year in advance the rates are going to be a bit higher (or a LOT higher) depending on the week and resort. Often our couples are still able to find some great deals during the \"shoulder\" months (like May-June or Nov-Dec) or of course during September-November.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you're flexible with the month and resort...since you're from Toronto (my hometown...yay!) you're really lucky because there are so many awesome charter options leaving from YYZ to CUN all year long!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy searching!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bicoastalimages@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.153.57.154","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1328007668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250764.jpg?_r=1392999583","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bicoastalimages","Id":250764,"Name":"bicoastalimages","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.222.165.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76701,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f76e4636222df1a571597cb20681f107","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;For some reason now I am having doubts about Hard Rock. Is there anyone who has looked at this resort or Dreams or Moon Palace. I am kind of interested in those now. I want to have a great time and my group is pretty young so I want somewhere that is going to have a very active vibe. We want a great night life and daytime life! Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1845111,"PostDate":1397844425,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>For some reason now I am having doubts about Hard Rock. Is there anyone who has looked at this resort or Dreams or Moon Palace. I am kind of interested in those now. I want to have a great time and my group is pretty young so I want somewhere that is going to have a very active vibe. We want a great night life and daytime life! Thank you!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aylanickens@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.120.68.249","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1383599312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274820.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ASAtobe","Id":274820,"Name":"ASAtobe","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":63,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
