{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":10,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":1324,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1883350,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281788,"Name":"bitbitz","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1421695026,"LastPoster":{"Id":280691,"Name":"starbx123","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1883350,"PostDate":1421695026,"PostContent":"I just came back from Cancun\/Riviera Maya resort site visits (6 resorts) and was disappointed by...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bitbitz110@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.18.225.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421692869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bitbitz","Id":281788,"Name":"bitbitz","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.18.225.180","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"036fb117631d7528e21c60ca268dbd9a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I just came back from Cancun\/Riviera Maya resort site visits (6 resorts) and was disappointed by the amount of seaweed I saw at the beaches. As much effort as the crew takes to clean up the seaweed, it was still no where near as perfect as the pictures that i see on their hotel site\/wedding pictures. I was wondering if anyone know what time of year has least seaweed or if anyone has recommendations which resorts to look at for nice beaches (for beach wedding). Dreams Riviera Cancun is gorgeous and I really want to have my wedding there, but I saw many comments\/review about the seaweed at their beach, so I&#039;m really concerned.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883350,"PostDate":1421695026,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I just came back from Cancun\/Riviera Maya resort site visits (6 resorts) and was disappointed by the amount of seaweed I saw at the beaches. As much effort as the crew takes to clean up the seaweed, it was still no where near as perfect as the pictures that i see on their hotel site\/wedding pictures. I was wondering if anyone know what time of year has least seaweed or if anyone has recommendations which resorts to look at for nice beaches (for beach wedding). Dreams Riviera Cancun is gorgeous and I really want to have my wedding there, but I saw many comments\/review about the seaweed at their beach, so I'm really concerned.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bitbitz110@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.18.225.180","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1421692869,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"bitbitz","Id":281788,"Name":"bitbitz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.184.85.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1547d0f513d093a39e30cc0050d81e9","RawContent":"The Iberostar complex has a beautiful beach except the grand (rocky). But they&#039;re not the greatest for weddings. I&#039;m having my wedding at dreams Riviera Cancun, and I know, the only thing I&#039;m not thrilled about is the amount of seagrass. It doesn&#039;t bother me too much though, and they do try their best to pick it up daily. I&#039;ve heard great things about secrets Maroma beach, but it is adults only and expensive.","Attachments":[],"Id":1883361,"PostDate":1421700168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                The Iberostar complex has a beautiful beach except the grand (rocky). But they're not the greatest for weddings. I'm having my wedding at dreams Riviera Cancun, and I know, the only thing I'm not thrilled about is the amount of seagrass. It doesn't bother me too much though, and they do try their best to pick it up daily. I've heard great things about secrets Maroma beach, but it is adults only and expensive. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"natalie.zaval@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.184.87.109","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1389131752,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275926.jpg?_r=1418313578","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nattiegams325","Id":275926,"Name":"nattiegams325","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb8797dab20373c652ce895d67e11280","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve stayed in Cancun (hotel zone) in May for 4 years in a row and have never seen much seaweed. But then again I don&#039;t know if it has anything to do with the time of year or if we just got lucky w our resort choices.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883435,"PostDate":1421768223,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've stayed in Cancun (hotel zone) in May for 4 years in a row and have never seen much seaweed. But then again I don't know if it has anything to do with the time of year or if we just got lucky w our resort choices.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391620956,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.149","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98608be1fb755ed468e904946c7b8da6","RawContent":"I&#039;ve stayed in cancun at the Riu hotels and grand Parnassus and haven&#039;t seen much seaweed, you&#039;d think it almost doesn&#039;t pile up overnight because the beach was always spotless \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1883515,"PostDate":1421788834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I've stayed in cancun at the Riu hotels and grand Parnassus and haven't seen much seaweed, you'd think it almost doesn't pile up overnight because the beach was always spotless <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359763104,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.186.135.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9a5b07277e2bfc3574060f72593e4f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;ve heard this is a bad year for seaweed?&amp;nbsp; Can anyone confirm\/deny?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889405,"PostDate":1426517724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I've heard this is a bad year for seaweed?\u00a0 Can anyone confirm\/deny?\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424056909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"801a68e1559a513516b8ce299636138d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh dang, I didn&#039;t realize the seaweed has gotten bad. This was the most recent review on Trip Advisor.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/ShowTopic-g150812-i23-k8133493-Seaweed_bad_at_Riu_Palace_Mexico_Playacar_area-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/ShowTopic-g150812-i23-k8133493-Seaweed_bad_at_Riu_Palace_Mexico_Playacar_area-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/mission-blue.org\/2014\/10\/sargassum-inundates-the-beaches-of-the-caribbean\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/mission-blue.org\/2014\/10\/sargassum-inundates-the-beaches-of-the-caribbean\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889413,"PostDate":1426522261,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh dang, I didn't realize the seaweed has gotten bad. This was the most recent review on Trip Advisor.\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.tripadvisor.com\/ShowTopic-g150812-i23-k8133493-Seaweed_bad_at_Riu_Palace_Mexico_Playacar_area-Playa_del_Carmen_Yucatan_Peninsula.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.tripadvis..._Peninsula.html<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/mission-blue.org\/2014\/10\/sargassum-inundates-the-beaches-of-the-caribbean\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/mission-blue....-the-caribbean\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><strong>N&C<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><em>April 17, 2015<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Gran Caribe Real (Cancun, Mexico)<\/p>\n<p>Including Bride & Groom: 22 guests (19 adults & 3 children)","Email":"nancysoup@att.net","IpAddress":"216.23.195.134","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411661062,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280004.jpg?_r=1412891058","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hellosassypants","Id":280004,"Name":"hellosassypants","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"138.229.193.9","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b3d1fe5542ee0a1cc1c4242f95a67cc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;is this really what deters people from where to get married? &amp;nbsp;If yes, plan on spending big bills at yes, such places as Secrets Maroma.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a secrets capri, there is seaweed.... but since living in So cal, I have noticed that&#039;s what happens when you&#039;re by the ocean.... you see seaweed, seagulls, and sharks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889427,"PostDate":1426524610,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>is this really what deters people from where to get married? \u00a0If yes, plan on spending big bills at yes, such places as Secrets Maroma.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm a secrets capri, there is seaweed.... but since living in So cal, I have noticed that's what happens when you're by the ocean.... you see seaweed, seagulls, and sharks.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lydiasusi1@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"97.94.99.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1384534767,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275069.jpg?_r=1389282466","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lydiasusi","Id":275069,"Name":"lydiasusi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91ad04ea3e19b3d2714e35846f34ead5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What a yucky feeling. Stepping on seaweed. :wacko:\n\n\nI didn&#039;t see any in the small man-made beach at Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya. However, there were plenty piled allong the rocky areas of the shore.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1889430,"PostDate":1426525726,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What a yucky feeling. Stepping on seaweed. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wacko.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wacko:' \/><br><br>\nI didn't see any in the small man-made beach at Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya. However, there were plenty piled allong the rocky areas of the shore.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our\u00a0perfect wedding in the Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Date:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 01\/15\/2015<\/p>\n<p>Resort:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Occidental Grand Xcaret - Riviera Maya, Mexico<br>\nGuests:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a070-80<br>\nPackage:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Custom<\/p>\n<p>Dress:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 David's Bridal<br>\nMinister:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Family Friend<\/p>\n<p>Photographer:\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0Decordova Photography ( <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.decordova.ca'>www.decordova.ca<\/a> )<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"emma.palmer@rogers.com","IpAddress":"67.17.215.182","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419945157,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"emmapalmer","Id":281523,"Name":"emmapalmer","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.219.69.198","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"598cae1ef52ef4b3692a6682bd94304a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"lydiasusi\" post=\"1889427\" timestamp=\"1426524610\"]\nis this really what deters people from where to get married?  If yes, plan on spending big bills at yes, such places as Secrets Maroma.\n\nI&#039;m a secrets capri, there is seaweed.... but since living in So cal, I have noticed that&#039;s what happens when you&#039;re by the ocean.... you see seaweed, seagulls, and sharks.[\/quote]I&#039;m personally just wondering because I don&#039;t remember a lot of seaweed in past visits and I&#039;m seeing these comments in a lot of reviews as severe as saying not many people were swimming in the ocean.  It is a factor for me yes, when deciding between Jamaica, Mexico and Dominican.  A game changer? Probably not, but a factor.   I&#039;m asking my guests to enjoy their vacation at a place I select.  So I want to ensure that I do the best I can picking the spot.   That takes in to consideration the pools, the beach, the food, the price.","Attachments":[],"Id":1889446,"PostDate":1426531295,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>lydiasusi, on 16 March 2015 - 08:50 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>is this really what deters people from where to get married?  If yes, plan on spending big bills at yes, such places as Secrets Maroma.<br><br>\nI'm a secrets capri, there is seaweed.... but since living in So cal, I have noticed that's what happens when you're by the ocean.... you see seaweed, seagulls, and sharks.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nI'm personally just wondering because I don't remember a lot of seaweed in past visits and I'm seeing these comments in a lot of reviews as severe as saying not many people were swimming in the ocean.  It is a factor for me yes, when deciding between Jamaica, Mexico and Dominican.  A game changer? Probably not, but a factor.   I'm asking my guests to enjoy their vacation at a place I select.  So I want to ensure that I do the best I can picking the spot.   That takes in to consideration the pools, the beach, the food, the price.  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"joanne.aguiar@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.234.116.105","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424056909,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282128.jpg?_r=1426731614","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":114,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JoannaBanana","Id":282128,"Name":"JoannaBanana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.72.4.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78635,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcf2cf1b80d8f245fc80e85e83b8bc18","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JoannaBanana\" post=\"1889446\" timestamp=\"1426531295\"]\nI&#039;m personally just wondering because I don&#039;t remember a lot of seaweed in past visits and I&#039;m seeing these comments in a lot of reviews as severe as saying not many people were swimming in the ocean.  It is a factor for me yes, when deciding between Jamaica, Mexico and Dominican.  A game changer? Probably not, but a factor.   I&#039;m asking my guests to enjoy their vacation at a place I select.  So I want to ensure that I do the best I can picking the spot.   That takes in to consideration the pools, the beach, the food, the price.[\/quote]\nI&#039;ve heard the same thing: bad year for seaweed in Mayan riviera. It&#039;s a factor for us too but unfortunately too late to change our location now. We&#039;re hoping the beach is still swimable and that they clear the seaweed for our beach-front wedding!","Attachments":[],"Id":1889797,"PostDate":1426653121,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>JoannaBanana, on 16 March 2015 - 10:41 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I'm personally just wondering because I don't remember a lot of seaweed in past visits and I'm seeing these comments in a lot of reviews as severe as saying not many people were swimming in the ocean.  It is a factor for me yes, when deciding between Jamaica, Mexico and Dominican.  A game changer? Probably not, but a factor.   I'm asking my guests to enjoy their vacation at a place I select.  So I want to ensure that I do the best I can picking the spot.   That takes in to consideration the pools, the beach, the food, the price.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI've heard the same thing: bad year for seaweed in Mayan riviera. It's a factor for us too but unfortunately too late to change our location now. We're hoping the beach is still swimable and that they clear the seaweed for our beach-front wedding!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tinsisienmay@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.74.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413556355,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"starbx123","Id":280691,"Name":"starbx123","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78635","Title":"Seaweed At The Beach?","LastPostDate":1426653121},"Pages":{"TotalItems":10,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":1,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
